        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Figure 3. FWSVD sensitivity to  $ (w_{\\mathrm{core}}, w_{\\mathrm{prot}}) $. Median relative bias in the science band as a function of  $ w_{\\mathrm{prot}} $ for several fixed values of  $ w_{\\mathrm{core}} $. Stronger down-weighting of the science core (smaller  $ w_{\\mathrm{core}} $) reduces the median bias, but gains saturate once  $ w_{\\mathrm{core}} \\lesssim 0.03-0.05 $.</div>\n",
            "block_bbox": [
